OL,3,GNEWSABar owners 'amazed' by support
OL,4,Aafter major city fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bar owner whose business was
OL,7,Fdestroyed in a fire said the support
OL,8,Fhis family has received has been
OL,9,F"amazing".
OL,11,FThe Grade II listed home of bar and
OL,12,Frestaurant Escobar, in Market Street,
OL,13,FNottingham, was severely damaged in the
OL,14,Ffire on 5 October.
OL,16,FPolice arrested two boys, 12 and 14, on
OL,17,Fsuspicion of arson following the blaze,
OL,18,Fwhich started in the roof.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
